# Copy to release/.release-env (or export in your shell) and fill in values.
# NEVER commit real values.

# Apple Developer account (the account that owns the Developer ID cert).
APPLE_ID=you@example.com
APPLE_TEAM_ID=XXXXXXXXXX

# App-specific password generated at https://appleid.apple.com (NOT your login password).
APPLE_PASSWORD=xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx

# Optional: Developer ID Application signing identity.
# Find with: security find-identity -v -p codesigning
# APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY="Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)"

# Optional: build target for release.sh, e.g. universal-apple-darwin.
# TARGET=universal-apple-darwin
